                    MassageStep("Still hands", cue: "Rest both palms still and breathe together", story: "The sleepy comet curled up on the moon, its tail glowing softly, and Lumi stuck it on your ceiling to glow all night. My skin is healing. I am safe. I am loved. Goodnight.", zones: ["tummy"], motion: "still", view: "front", reps: "3 slow breaths", seconds: 60, isOptional: false),
